# Seller Account

A seller account allows you to publish and manage digital products on the Codexeron Marketplace.

Before submitting products, you must complete your seller profile and agree to the Marketplace Terms.

---

## Eligibility

To become a seller, you must:

- Have a registered Codexeron account.
- Verify your email address.
- Accept the Marketplace Terms.
- Provide accurate account information.

Additional verification may be required in certain cases.

---

## Seller Profile

Your seller profile represents you on the marketplace.

We recommend including:

- Display Name
- Profile Image
- Short Biography
- Website (Optional)
- GitHub Profile (Optional)
- Support Contact (Optional)

A complete profile helps build trust with buyers.

---

## Account Responsibilities

As a seller, you are responsible for:

- Publishing original content.
- Keeping products up to date.
- Providing accurate product information.
- Respecting intellectual property rights.
- Responding to customer inquiries professionally.

---

## Account Security

To help protect your account:

- Use a strong password.
- Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) when available.
- Never share your login credentials.
- Regularly review account activity.

---

## Account Status

Your seller account may have one of the following statuses:

| Status | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| Active | Your account is in good standing and can publish products. |
| Pending Review | Your account or submitted information is being reviewed. |
| Restricted | Some seller features are temporarily limited. |
| Suspended | Your seller privileges have been suspended due to policy violations. |

---

## Best Practices

Successful sellers usually:

- Publish high-quality products.
- Maintain clear documentation.
- Respond to support requests promptly.
- Keep products updated.
- Follow marketplace policies.

